[al:新概念英语（一）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Is That All?]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.71]Lesson 59 | 第59课
[00:03.20]Is that all? | 就这些吗?
[00:06.18]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.77]Does the lady buy any chalk? | 那位女士买粉笔了吗?
[00:16.33]I want some envelopes, please. | 请给我一些信封。
[00:20.25]Do you want the large size or the small size? | 你要大号的还是小号的?
[00:25.21]The large size, please. | 请来大号的。
[00:28.55]Do you have any writing paper? | 你有信纸吗?
[00:31.84]Yes, we do. | 是的,我们有。
[00:34.41]I don't have any small pads. | 我没有小号的本子。
[00:38.34]I only have large ones. | 我只有大号的。
[00:41.66]Do you want a pad? | 你要一本吗?
[00:44.17]Yes, please. | 好的,请给我一本。
[00:46.44]And I want some glue. | 我还要一些胶水。
[00:49.87]A bottle of glue. | 一瓶胶水。
[00:53.06]And I want a large box of chalk, too. | 我还要一大盒粉笔。
[00:58.21]I only have small boxes. | 我只有小盒的。
[01:01.46]Do you want one? | 你要一盒吗?
[01:03.08]No, thank you. | 不,谢谢你。
[01:04.94]Is that all? | 就这些吗?
[01:06.57]That's all, thank you. | 就这些,谢谢。
[01:09.29]What else do you want? | 你还要别的什么吗?
[01:11.55]I want my change. | 我要找零。